{
  "name": "s150-skill-compliance-reminder-reaches-claude",
  "setup_files": {
    "src/app.ts": "export const x = 1;\n"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "hook": ".claude/hooks/skill-compliance.sh",
      "payload": { "tool_name": "Edit", "tool_input": { "file_path": "{TMPROOT}/src/app.ts" } },
      "expect": {
        "exit_code": 0,
        "stdout_contains": ["{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"PostToolUse\",\"additionalContext\":\"SKILL_COMPLIANCE: Edited app.ts"],
        "stdout_not_contains": ["\n{", "\nSKILL_COMPLIANCE"]
      }
    },
    {
      "hook": ".claude/hooks/skill-compliance.sh",
      "payload": { "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": { "command": "ls src" } },
      "expect": { "exit_code": 0, "stdout_empty": true }
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Strict profile hook. The reminder was plain stdout at exit 0, which for PostToolUse only reaches the debug log — Claude never saw it. It is now PostToolUse additionalContext JSON (one object); a non-edit tool still prints nothing."
}
